    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPositioned within the exclusive gated setting of The Cornmill, No. 18 is a beautifully presented third-floor apartment offering an exceptional blend of comfort, style and convenience in the very heart of Balbriggan. Freshly repainted throughout and impeccably maintained, this elegant two-bedroom residence is ready for immediate occupation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, professionals, downsizers or investors seeking a quality home in a prime coastal location.\nThe apartment is designed to maximise natural light, with bright and spacious living accommodation creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere from the moment you step inside. The generous open-plan living and dining area enjoys an abundance of daylight and is enhanced by French doors opening onto a charming Juliet balcony, providing an inviting focal point and a pleasant outlook. The well-appointed shaker-style cream kitchen offers timeless appeal, featuring an excellent range of fitted units and ample workspace, perfectly suited to both everyday living and entertaining.\nThe accommodation continues with two generously proportioned bedrooms, complemented by a well-finished family bathroom, delivering a practical yet stylish layout that caters effortlessly to modern lifestyles. Gas-fired central heating, powered by an efficient combi boiler, together with uPVC double-glazed windows throughout, ensures year-round comfort and energy efficiency.\nThe Cornmill is a mature and highly regarded residential development, accessed through secure electronic gates and offering private residents' parking, providing both peace of mind and convenience. Its enviable town centre location places every conceivable amenity within easy walking distance, including an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and local services. Balbriggan's picturesque sandy beach and vibrant harbour are just moments away, while the nearby train station offers regular commuter services to Dublin City Centre. For those travelling further afield, Exit 5 of the M1 motorway is close at hand, providing swift access to Dublin Airport, the city centre and the wider national road network.\nCombining stylish interiors, secure surroundings and an outstanding location, No. 18 The Cornmill presents a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of North County Dublin's most convenient and well-connected residential developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 5.31m x 1.20m\nlaminate flooring and storage room\n\nKitchen - 4.07m x 2.77m\nwith shaker cream kitchen with countertops, built in hob, over and extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine\n\nLiving Room - 4.07m x 3.67m\n\n\nBalcony - 1.90m x 0.57m\nsmall balcony with railings\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.43m x 4.29m\nlarge double room with lamanite flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.11m x 4.28m\nlarge double room with built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.08m x 2.03m\nwith tiled flooring, bath with tiling around and shower head connection, wc and whb\n\n"
      },
      {
