        "Content": "<ul><li>Wonderful 2 bed 3rd floor apartment</li><li>Freshly repainted throughout</li><li>Brights living accommodation with French door to Juliet balcony</li><li>Excellent shaker cream wood kitchen</li><li>Mature town centre development with secure parking</li><li>Gas central heating with combi boiler</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows</li><li>Enclosed gated development </li><li>Private parking for residents only</li><li>Town centre location </li><li>Double Glazed windows </li><li>Mins. Walk to train station and beach</li><li>Close to exit 5, M1 motor easy access to Dublin airport and city</ul>"
